message.content:
Fix two issues in the progress tracking implementation.

## Working directory (absolute)
`C:\Users\redna\.claude\.claude\worktrees\thirsty-roentgen-fc40ad`

## Issue 1: Rules of Hooks violation in DocumentWorkspace.tsx

READ `ivdr-wiki/src/components/DocumentWorkspace.tsx`.

The component currently has this structure (problematic):
```tsx
export function DocumentWorkspace() {
  const { id } = useParams();
  const doc = id ? resolveDoc(id) : undefined;
  const station = doc ? stations.find((s) => s.id === doc.stationId) : undefined;

  if (!doc || !station) {   // ← early return
    return (...);
  }

  // ... other code ...

  const { getStatus, setStatus } = useProgress("ivdr");  // ← hooks after early return!
  const status = getStatus(doc.id);
  const nextStatus = STATUS_NEXT[status];
```

Fix: Move the `useProgress` call (and derived `status`, `nextStatus`) to BEFORE the `if (!doc || !station)` guard. Since `doc.id` may be undefined at that point, adjust the code to handle this:

```tsx
export function DocumentWorkspace() {
  const { id } = useParams();
  const doc = id ? resolveDoc(id) : undefined;
  const station = doc ? stations.find((s) => s.id === doc.stationId) : undefined;

  // Hooks must be called before any conditional returns
  const { getStatus, setStatus } = useProgress("ivdr");
  const status = doc ? getStatus(doc.id) : "not_started";
  const nextStatus = STATUS_NEXT[status];

  if (!doc || !station) {
    return (...);
  }
  // ... rest of component
```

Find the exact lines in the file and make this structural change. The hook call and derived variables must come BEFORE the early return.

## Issue 2: saveProgress lacks error handling in progress.ts

READ `ivdr-wiki/src/data/progress.ts`.

Find the `saveProgress` function:
```ts
function saveProgress(certId: string, map: ProgressMap) {
  localStorage.setItem(storageKey(certId), JSON.stringify(map));
}
```

Wrap it in try/catch:
```ts
function saveProgress(certId: string, map: ProgressMap) {
  try {
    localStorage.setItem(storageKey(certId), JSON.stringify(map));
  } catch {
    // localStorage quota exceeded or unavailable — ignore, progress just won't persist
  }
}
```

## Steps

1. Read both files
2. Apply fix to `DocumentWorkspace.tsx` (move hooks before early return)
3. Apply fix to `progress.ts` (add try/catch to saveProgress)
4. Build: `cd ivdr-wiki && npm run build`
5. Fix any errors
6. Commit:
```bash
git add ivdr-wiki/src/components/DocumentWorkspace.tsx ivdr-wiki/src/data/progress.ts
git commit -m "fix: move useProgress before early return, guard saveProgress against quota errors"
```

## Status
End with `STATUS: DONE` or `STATUS: BLOCKED [reason]`

